etics\n-  Use the tools you can find to defend yourself\n- Find all of the generators and escape", "short_description": "Hiding Apes is a game that launches you into a bright office space with the only exit being through the large caves area. Find the generators, and escape. Don't get caught by what waits for you in the dark.\nUse many free cosmetics, Tools, and items to assist you in your journey."}]}, "developer_name": "MitchellGamz", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/hiding-apes/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MitchellGamz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/hiding-apes/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24565414796482341"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302770_1611189156511301_5259591122915410980_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HfoJTVlZaMwQ7kNvwH9x9Rs&_nc_oc=Adl_9-KhbHun3GjRMBUCjABgb9LtN7zn5rmNga79C7SGJ0c6gMPr8VSHgwy0j7D2ySs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwBP8fcaK_rzGV0fz5R3GDKAmNd2H_Hgp6WQNcK3crDDg&oe=69BFE9F5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Hiding Apes", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF